// Potential Registry Persistence Attempt Via Windows Telemetry | T1053.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_telemetry_persistence.yml
(registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\ NT\\CurrentVersion\\AppCompatFlags\\TelemetryController\\* AND registry.path:*\\Command AND (winlog.event_data.Details:(*.bat* OR *.bin* OR *.cmd* OR *.dat* OR *.dll* OR *.exe* OR *.hta* OR *.jar* OR *.js* OR *.msi* OR *.ps* OR *.sh* OR *.vb*))) AND (NOT (winlog.event_data.Details:(*\\system32\\CompatTelRunner.exe* OR *\\system32\\DeviceCensus.exe*)))
